## the answer must be one of the package's options
$ gov --json --session probe-ae1a0e81 decide HDG-0002 --option Z --rationale 'not an offered option'
  -> ERROR [GATE_OPTION_INVALID] 'Z' is not an option of HDG-0002; the answer must be one of ["A", "B"]
CHECK L2.b4.answer PASS an answer naming an option that the package does not offer is refused
