$ gov --json --session probe-ae1a0e81 gate present HDG-0001
  -> ok
$ gov --json --session probe-ae1a0e81 decide HDG-0001 --option C
  -> ERROR [GATE_OPTION_INVALID] 'C' is not an option of HDG-0001; the answer must be one of ["A", "B"]
CHECK L2.b4.answer2 PASS an answer 'C' to a gate offering only A/B is refused
      detail: {"code": "GATE_OPTION_INVALID", "details": {"offered": ["A", "B"]}, "message": "'C' is not an option of HDG-0001; the answer must be one of [\"A\", \"B\"]"}

